# specsfy cli
# `.specsfy/` e `specs/` deixaram de ser ignorados: passaram a ser o contrato do
# framework e o registro normativo das decisões da reescrita v1.0. Precisam estar
# versionados para sobreviver ao congelamento da v0.2.8 e à raiz órfã da Phase 0.
skills-lock.json

# Virtual environments
.venv
.venv*/

# Logs
notebook

# Editor exports written by sync_to_ide. These are generated from the resource
# kit on demand, so committing them would create a second source of truth that
# goes stale silently. `.common-rules-server/config.env` is deliberately NOT
# ignored — this project dogfoods its own configuration and the file is meant to
# be reviewed and committed.
#
# `.claude/` e `.agents` saíram desta lista. O motivo acima vale para saída
# gerada pelo sync_to_ide; hoje esses caminhos carregam as skills Specsfy
# configuradas e os scripts de asserção da Phase 0, que são fonte, não export.
.cursor/
CLAUDE.md
AGENTS.md

# Machine-specific MCP wiring: the entries carry absolute paths, so committing
# one would hand every other clone a path that does not exist there.
.mcp.json

# Environment variables
.env

